                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "summary": "Revokes the session by its identity and leaves the cookies untouched — they\nmay belong to whoever is active now, and the revoked session's rows are\ndeleted so any lingering cookie is inert (it dies on next sign-in or at\ncookie expiry).",
        "tags": [
          "Auth"
        ]
      }
    },
